    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The residents of the Solar System have been frozen in Staseo Magnesius!! The Bear And The Admiral is a 2-D Platformer/ Run and Gun game with a bright cartoony art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through 6 weird worlds with over 50 levels and a dozen boss fights and save the day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the Bear or the Admiral in single player or local co-op (a controller is required for local multiplayer) as you battle bizarre enemies with an array of weapons and pickups including jet-packs, pogo sticks and bouncy grenades.</p>",
